1/threads/{threadId}POST   /api/v1/forums/{forumId}/threadsDELETE /api/v1/threads/{threadId}THREAD MODERATION────────────────────────────────────────PUT    /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/pinDELETE /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/pinPUT    /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/lockDELETE /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/lockCOMMENTS────────────────────────────────────────GET    /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/commentsPOST   /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/commentsGET    /api/v1/comments/{commentId}/repliesPOST   /api/v1/comments/{commentId}/repliesVOTING────────────────────────────────────────PUT    /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/voteDELETE /api/v1/threads/{threadId}/votePUT    /api/v1/comments/{commentId}/voteDELETE /api/v1/comments/{commentId}/voteTAGS────────────────────────────────────────GET    /api/v1/tagsGET    /api/v1/tags/{tagSlug}/threadsREPORTING────────────────────────────────────────POST   /api/v1/reportsMODERATION────────────────────────────────────────GET    /api/v1/moderation/reportsPATCH  /api/v1/moderation/reports/{reportId}RACESERVICE────────────────────────────────────────GET    /api/v1/races/{raceId}/threads```---# 32. APIs deliberately excluded from MVPDo **not** build these yet:```text❌ Bookmarks❌ Following threads❌ Notifications❌ User reputation❌ User activity❌ Global search❌ Recommendations❌ Awards/reactions❌ Advanced spam detection❌ AI moderation❌ Real-time WebSockets❌ Advanced analytics```They can be added later without fundamentally changing the core model.---# 33. Core MVP domain modelThe resulting domain is intentionally small:```textCategory   │   └── Forum         │         └── Thread               │               └── Comment                    │                    ├── Comment                    │    └── Comment                    │                    └── Comment```Supporting:```textThread ──── Tag   │   └──── RaceId → RaceServiceComment ─── VoteThread  ─── VoteThread / Comment ─── Report```And external ownership:```text             UserService                  │                  │ UserId                  ▼            ForumService                  │                  │ RaceId                  ▼             RaceService```This is the scope I would freeze for the **ForumService MVP** before moving on to the database/domain design.